colophons.text:
4 colophons and 24 additional seals: 

1 colophon, dated 1811, and 5 seals of Xiang Yuan 項源 (active about 1811); 
1 colophon, dated 1858, and 2 seals of Qi Junzao 祁寯藻 (1793–1866); 
1 colophon and 4 seals of Zhang Yunzhong 張允中 (1881–1960?); 
4 seals of Jiang Xun 江恂 (active about 1753–after 1780); 
1 colophon dated 1943, and 2 seals of Wang Shaoming 汪兆銘 (Wang Jingwei 汪精衛, 1883–1944); 
1 seal of Qi Zhiliu 祁之鏐 (active about 1858); 
2 seals of Yu Zhimeng 俞芷盟 (second half of 19th century); 
4 seals unidentified.
